---
import Base from "@/layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
  title="About · Ethan Justice"
  description="Cloud Security Analyst. M.S. Cybersecurity. Google Cloud Digital Leader, ISC2 CC. DOE CyberForce top-5 finish."
>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 pb-20 pt-32">
    <p class="label mb-4">About</p>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.02em] md:text-5xl">Ethan Justice</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-muted">
      Cloud Security Analyst at a Fortune 500 insurer. I work where governance meets automation:
      making sure cloud environments are configured right, and building the workflows that keep them
      that way. Off the clock I run a Proxmox homelab with production-grade controls and ship side
      projects with real users.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
      <section class="hairline rounded-xl2 bg-obsidian-800/60 p-6">
        <h2 class="label mb-3">Education</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed">M.S. Cybersecurity, 2025<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">Lewis University, 4+1 program, GPA 3.9</span></p>
        <p class="mt-3 leading-relaxed">B.S. Cybersecurity, 2024<br /><span class="text-ink-muted">Lewis University, GPA 3.8, Dean's List</span></p>
      </section>
      <section class="hairline rounded-xl2 bg-obsidian-800/60 p-6">
        <h2 class="label mb-3">Certifications</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 leading-relaxed">
          <li>Google Cloud Digital Leader</li>
          <li>ISC2 Certified in Cybersecurity (CC)</li>
          <li class="text-ink-muted">PADI certified diver, for the record</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
      <section class="hairline rounded-xl2 bg-obsidian-800/60 p-6 md:col-span-2">
        <h2 class="label mb-3">Competitions</h2>
        <ul class="grid gap-2 font-mono text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
          <li><span class="text-accent">5th / 160</span> · DOE CyberForce 2022</li>
          <li><span class="text-accent">10th / 120</span> · DOE CyberForce 2021</li>
          <li><span class="text-accent">1st</span> · Lewis Cyber Flyer CTF 2021</li>
          <li><span class="text-accent">CCDC</span> · National Collegiate Cyber Defense Competition</li>
        </ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
      <a href="/resume.pdf" class="rounded-full bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-obsidian hover:bg-white">Resume (PDF)</a>
      <a href="mailto:Justice.ethan04@gmail.com" class="hairline rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm hover:bg-obsidian-800">Email</a>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/justice-ethan/" class="hairline rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm hover:bg-obsidian-800" rel="me">LinkedIn</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Tsuji-Hub" class="hairline rounded-full px-5 py-2.5 text-sm hover:bg-obsidian-800" rel="me">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </article>
</Base>
